  "published": "2026-11-17T05:09:48.2Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0: Config: replaced free-form `IFrameEndpoint` with a `Staging` boolean (ucprod default / ucstaging); the connector builds the host. The IntelligenceBank app handle now consistently follows `InsertionMode` (optimizely_public / optimizely_no_public) across all three patterns; the rich-text button previously ignored it. `IFrameEndpoint` still honored as a legacy override. Fix: a selection made in one IntelligenceBank picker or the rich-text button no longer also lands in the other IntelligenceBank fields on the same page, and the rich-text button inserts into the editor it was clicked in. Fix: an asset picked for an IntelligenceBank property (such as a hero image) in the All Properties view is now saved; before, it showed in the form but was never saved. Security: the picker no longer stores IntelligenceBank thumbnail or download URLs that carry the editor's IntelligenceBank session, and in localDownloads mode the rich-text button stores a local copy instead of inserting the session-bearing download URL. The package now refuses Optimizely CMS 13: use IntelligenceBank.OptimizelyCMS13 there.",
